// Drifting boulders of asteroid belt levels (M4 Belt Up; docs/milestone-4-plan.md §3.8
// "Drifting boulders"). Schema: `ls_sim::obstacle::BoulderSettings`. Speeds in u/s.
// Boulders orbit the belt axis on seeded circles (`ls_math::level::BoulderOrbit`, positions a
// pure function of the tick); they are indestructible, absorb projectiles (ordnance detonates
// on them without craters) and push ships aside, bouncing them off with `restitution`. A
// contact faster than `damage_speed` (relative, along the contact normal) deals `damage`
// (no kill credit). Changing a number changes the data hash (handshake).
BoulderSettings(
    damage: 8.0,
    damage_speed: 8.0,
    restitution: 0.3,
)
